- Update to 0.9.0 (upstream tag v0.9.0, 2026-10-18):
  * Rendering: Poppler render oracle with pixel test on; JBIG2
    conformance fixtures; page-transform precision; Indexed samples
    clamped to the palette range.
  * Printing and redaction: off layers stay off; repeated redaction
    overlays reused; undo keeps the last saved revision.
  * UI: drag files onto the Pages panel to insert; text selection
    drag-scrolls and extends by word/line; dragged images follow the
    frame; page labels and navigation stay consistent.
  * pdfcraft-no-brand-assets.patch refreshed for the moved widgets.rs
    (same three trademark embeds, new line numbers). Re-vendored
    (update=false kept for --locked; respect-lockfile true); license
    re-derived over shipped targets, no new copyleft (new crates all
    MIT/Apache), tag stands; no new system deps.

